    "AppActions": {
      "AIPrompt": "ClueBook Module Data Structure (JSON):\n\nGLOBAL STRUCTURE:\n1. The \"entries\" array — contains all cards.\n\nCARDS (\"entries\"):\nRequired fields:\n- \"id\": Unique string identifier. (Use simple IDs, e.g. \"npc1\", \"clue2\").\n- \"tab\": Card type (\"notes\", \"npc\", \"quests\", \"timeline\", \"locations\").\n- \"color\": Card color: predefined (\"yellow\", \"red\", \"green\", \"blue\", \"purple\", \"orange\", \"teal\", \"pink\", \"brown\") or any HEX code.\n- \"tags\": Array of string tags (e.g. [\"Clue\", \"Witness\", \"Conspiracy\"]).\n\nFields by type (\"tab\"):\n- notes: \"text\" (main text), \"name\" (title).\n- npc: \"name\" (name), \"location\" (location), \"attitude\" (attitude), \"lifeStatus\" (\"alive\", \"unknown\", \"dead\"), \"note\" (description).\n- quests: \"text\" (description), \"status\" (\"active\", \"completed\", \"failed\"), \"timeMode\" (\"by\", \"at\"), \"deadlineTimestamp\" (UNIX number, if calendar is active) or \"deadline\" (string).\n- timeline: \"event\" (what happened), \"startTimestamp\" (UNIX number), \"endTimestamp\" (UNIX number). If no calendar, use \"time\".\n- locations: \"name\" (name), \"subtitle\" (subtitle/region), \"owner\" (key NPC/owner), \"note\" (description).{gmNotesFieldText}\n{calendarInfo}\n\nCARD MANAGEMENT (ADD, UPDATE, DELETE):\nYou can pass an optional \"action\" field (\"create\", \"update\", \"delete\").\n- \"action\": \"create\" (or omitted) — updates if exists, creates if not.\n- \"action\": \"update\" (or \"edit\") — updates fields of existing card.\n- \"action\": \"delete\" (or \"remove\") — deletes the card.\n\nATTENTION FOR AI (CRITICAL INSTRUCTION):\nIt is STRICTLY FORBIDDEN to generate any internal links or mentions between cards. Your response must contain ONLY the \"entries\" array and nothing else! Strictly follow this structure.",
      "AIPromptCalendarActive": "\nA calendar module is ACTIVE in your world!\nDates must be UNIX timestamps (in seconds).\nCurrent game time: {date} {time} (UNIX: {currentTs}).\nAdd seconds to {currentTs} (86400 = 1 day) to set a future date.",
      "AIPromptCalendarInactive": "\nA calendar module is NOT ACTIVE in your world.\nDates are passed as regular text strings (e.g., \"12:00\", \"Tomorrow\").",
      "AIPromptGMNotes": "\n- All cards can have a \"gmNotes\" field (hidden GM notes).",
